        </p>

        <p>
          You may not share, sell, transfer, or otherwise provide your account
          to another person without our written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Eligibility</h2>

        <p>
          You must meet the minimum legal age required in your jurisdiction to
          create a Mind Arc Network account. If you are under the age of
          majority, you may only use our services with permission from a parent
